       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SUPER8-FILM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SUPER8-FILM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CARTRIDGE-LATCH-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PRESSURE-PLATE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EMULSION-GRAIN-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRANSPORT-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRANSPORT-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SUPER8-FILM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PFT-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PFT-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LATCH-AND-PLATE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-GRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PFT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LATCH-AND-PLATE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CARTRIDGE-LATCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PRESSURE-PLATE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-GRAIN-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EMULSION-GRAIN-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRANSPORT-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PFT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CARTRIDGE-LATCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PRESSURE-PLATE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-EMULSION-GRAIN-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TRANSPORT-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TRANSPORT-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PFT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PFT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PFT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PFT-CODE.
